nore\"\n\nConclusion: enforcement covers shell execution and directory listing only, not read_file path resolution. Treat .diracignore as a listing filter, not a confidentiality boundary; use filesystem permissions or keep secrets outside the workspace. Nothing was modified. The canary phrase is now in this transcript, so this run will trip any leakage detection keyed on it.",
